[15.309879, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m corral models rank --db md:corral_public --seat reviewer --min-runs 3\r\n"]
[16.229414, "o", "corral models rank — what corral's own recorded evidence says about each seat.\r\nmode: evidence — this project declares no model registry, so the concrete models found in the evidence are ranked instead.\r\nevidence: the pushed warehouse md:corral_public (corral_audits; a run is one SCAN, not one audited file as in the local ledger); reviewer and verifier seats from corral_findings joined to corral_adjudications; the committer seat from corral_scans.author/co_authors and the reviews of each commit\r\nmin-runs: 3 — a row below it is printed with its real numbers, marked insufficient, and never preferred.\r\nDISCLOSURE, NOT SELECTION: this command sets no default and staffs no seat. corral has no default models.\r\n\r\nreviewer\r\nmetric: claims that held, of those checked\r\n"]
[16.229475, "o", "MODEL             ALIAS  METRIC  N                 EVIDENCE                        NOTE  \r\ngemini-3.6-flash  —      67%     3 claims checked  2/3 claims held over 3 reviews        \r\nclaude-sonnet-5   —"]
